## Part 2: Lpdf engine

Applies to the files in `wasm/`. The engine is owned by Codesense LLC and is not open source.

Anyone may use the engine through this extension, as published by Codesense LLC, free of charge, for any purpose, including the PDFs it produces. PDFs rendered without a license key carry the "Made with Lpdf" attribution, which may not be removed.

Using the engine files outside this extension is governed by the Lpdf License: https://lpdf.io/license

The engine is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The Disclaimer of Warranty and the limit of liability in the Lpdf License apply to it.
